---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Support | 7 Days to Die Cheats" description="Support and purchasing guidance for Days Cheats visitors."><section class="pt-28 pb-20 md:pt-36"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5"><p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-primary">Support</p><h1 class="mt-3 font-[family-name:var(--font-heading)] text-5xl font-bold uppercase">Need help?</h1><div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-7 text-muted-foreground"><p>For orders, billing, downloads, or availability, contact the merchant shown at checkout. Keep your order reference available and never share passwords, authentication codes, or account credentials.</p><p class="mt-5">For game issues, use the official 7 Days to Die support channels and the relevant server administrator for server-specific questions.</p><a class="mt-7 inline-flex rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-primary-foreground" href="/faq/">Read the FAQ →</a></div></div></section></BaseLayout>
